--><rss xmlns:sparkle="http://www.andymatuschak.org/xml-namespaces/sparkle" version="2.0"><channel><title>AndroidADBTool 更新</title><language>zh-CN</language><item><title>AndroidADBTool 1.0.16</title><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 03:31:05 GMT</pubDate><sparkle:version>20261118112639</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.16</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>11.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;新增内嵌项目问答，可在工具内直接提问、选择项目版本并添加日志或截图。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;接入团队问答服务，测试人员无需准备源码、安装 Codex 或配置模型账号。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;优化问答会话保留、页面切换、刷新、复制粘贴与服务地址配置。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;新增增量自动更新，匹配旧构建时优先下载差分包。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;增量下载、校验或应用失败时自动回退完整包，完整包继续验证签名。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;发布流程增加差分还原校验，支持最近三个正式构建的增量升级。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/zj-kechangjie/android_tool_plus-updates/releases/download/v1.0.16/AndroidADBTool-1.0.16-20261118112639-AppleSilicon.zip" length="31893677" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="BJ5+KtJSpZ5nVy4jutp7yyE8Ftc14GdWleI87ohptmDbphtaJFTpqhQRRbkwgsRlmNRyTDxfiArR29y22GPCAw=="></enclosure><sparkle:deltas><enclosure url="https://github.com/zj-kechangjie/android_tool_plus-updates/releases/download/v1.0.16/AndroidADBTool-1.0.16-20261118112639-from-20261117120214-AppleSilicon.delta" length="1675090" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:deltaFrom="20261117120214" sparkle:edSignature="zeHcA482+YPcaixOFuEDjWueM1yhDJkAeem3hh3N2iVn1jz8EJPOhYMccW/HlBAK+JseVUAENXZwQk99Rhw0AA==" sparkle:deltaFromSparkleExecutableSize="977616" sparkle:deltaFromSparkleLocales="Base,ar,ca,cs,da,de,el,es,fa,fi,fr,he,hr,hu,is,it,ja,ko,nb,nl,nn,pl,pt-BR,pt-PT,ro,ru,sk,sl,sv,th,tr,uk,vi,zh_CN,zh_HK,zh_TW"></enclosure><enclo